        {
          "name": "fieldMappingProductStape",
          "value": "{\"8533107540207\":{\"category\":\"Uncategorized\",\"collections\":[{\"id\":445283274,\"title\":\"All Products\",\"handle\":\"all-products\"},{\"id\":507286192367,\"title\":\"Best Sellers\",\"handle\":\"best-sellers\"},{\"id\":451440541935,\"title\":\"BFCM Early Bird\",\"handle\":\"bogo\"},{\"id\":161165443149,\"title\":\"Coolers\",\"handle\":\"coolers\"},{\"id\":494865481967,\"title\":\"EV - 25/65 Flash Sale\",\"handle\":\"ev-25-65-flash-sale\"},{\"id\":494865318127,\"title\":\"EV - 25s & 65s\",\"handle\":\"ev-25s-65s\"},{\"id\":470196420847,\"title\":\"Father's Day\",\"handle\":\"fathers-day\"}],\"metafields\":{\"custom\":{\"build_technology\":\"<div id=\\\"build-technology-slider\\\" class=\\\"slick-slider\\\">\\n        <div>\\n                <img src=\\\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2280/5831/files/rigorite_photo.png?v=1760995761\\\">\\n                <h3>Rigorite\u2122 Coating</h3>\\n                <p>Designed to endure the toughest outdoor challenges, this cooler\u2019s blast-proof shell provides maximum protection.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n                <img src=\\\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2280/5831/files/fridgite_photo.png?v=1760995891\\\">\\n                <h3>Fridgite\u2122 Insulative Technology</h3>\\n                <p>With advanced insulation, your ice stays frozen for up to 7 days, so your provisions stay cold no matter where the road takes you.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n                <img src=\\\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2280/5831/files/float_photo.png?v=1760996024\\\">\\n                <h3>\u201cHeads-Up\u201d Floatability\u2122</h3>\\n                <p>The Rugged Road 25 V2 floats upright, keeping everything dry and accessible so you can focus on enjoying your time on the water.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n                <img src=\\\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2280/5831/files/kick_flip_photo.png?v=1760996127\\\">\\n                <h3>Kick Flip Lid\u2122</h3>\\n                <p>Reversible lid with cup holders? Check. Built-in cutting board? Check. This cooler is ready for the every day and the extraordinary.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n                <img src=\\\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2280/5831/files/handle_latch_photo.png?v=1760996206\\\">\\n                <h3>EASY LATCH SYSTEM</h3>\\n                <p>The convenient self-closing handle latch system makes carrying and closing the cooler a breeze. Add the optional padded carry strap for hands-free portability!</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n                <img src=\\\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2280/5831/files/nonslip_photo.png?v=1760996371\\\">\\n                <h3>\u201cGet A Grip\u201d Non-Slip Surface</h3>\\n                <p>This cooler stays put, even on slick surfaces. The non-slip exterior keeps it in place on boat decks, truck beds, and uneven terrain.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div>\\n                <img src=\\\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2280/5831/files/ultralight_photo.png?v=1760996462\\\">\\n                <h3>Ultralight</h3>\\n                <p>With all the perks of a hard-side at the weight of a soft-side, the Rugged Road 25 V2 offers easy portability while maintaining ample storage capacity.</p>\\n        </div>\\n</div>\",\"collection_image\":\"//ruggedroadoutdoors.com/cdn/shop/files/files/3_ed2cb67b-430a-4ad4-84b1-6e8a9094d795.png?v=17019\",\"cooler-dimension-image\":\"//ruggedroadoutdoors.com/cdn/shop/files/files/45_dim_vertical.jpg?v=17019\"}},\"variants\":{\"45165675446511\":{\"barcode\":\"850058439471\"}}}}"
